{"4686060": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "SHE: Seraphim Helix Experiment", "steam_appid": 4686060, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4913960], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SHE is a retro survival horror game visually inspired by Akira, and blends classic third-person <br>survival horror gameplay with the tactical stealth action of Metal Gear Solid 2.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4686060/extras/887f3426e84c05f0397a5b09d60ebf9f.webp?t=1784047129\" width=616 height=63 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4686060/extras/31fdec8605ecdc28ea39f8410df0a9ca.poster.avif?t=1784047129\" width=614 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4686060/extras/31fdec8605ecdc28ea39f8410df0a9ca.webm?t=1784047129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4686060/extras/31fdec8605ecdc28ea39f8410df0a9ca.mp4?t=1784047129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is the near future, and the world powers are on the verge of a hot war. An unearthed ancient <br>entity lies suspended at the bottom of a frozen missile silo. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Robin finds herself in an underground base in the Alaskan Archipelago. Strange abominations <br>that were once the staff and military personnel roam the halls in a murderous fugue state. <br>All the base's systems are malfunctioning or on the verge of collapse, and a directive to launch <br>the base's payload repeats endlessly from Central Command. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With no one to trust except the voices over the radio and her instincts, Robin must use her <br>knowledge and expertise to survive, reach her objectives, and make an impossible decision. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4686060/extras/a49088cf3ae549f95710ab729c1cf1e1.webp?t=1784047129\" width=616 height=63 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4686060/extras/a62a5d359c04b7a0aa27797b9aa81720.poster.avif?t=1784047129\" width=614 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4686060/extras/a62a5d359c04b7a0aa27797b9aa81720.webm?t=1784047129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4686060/extras/a62a5d359c04b7a0aa27797b9aa81720.mp4?t=1784047129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approach survival situations in multiple ways. Go in fast, loud, and deadly using valuable <br>resources and close-quarter combat. Or take is slow, silent, and stealthy, conserving ammo and <br>leaving threats in your shadow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4686060/extras/f1246750fa2ba23182b12171180df2d9.webp?t=1784047129\" width=616 height=63 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A geneticist trapped in her lab knows more than she lets on about the biological and existential <br>threat of the entity. The Staff Sargent who has miraculously avoided contamination, desperately <br>orders you to restore proper operations to the silo. But his orders come from the top, a broadcast <br>from The Allied Coalition of the Willing Nations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4686060/extras/0fe2652803818068dcf2ad8a71070574.webp?t=1784047129\" width=616 height=63 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate through non-linear levels, avoiding traps or using them to your advantage. Use gadgets <br>to clear your way through enemies, malfunctioning turrets, and the broken systems of the Silo. <br>Adapt to the ever-changing environment as your situation spirals into chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4686060/extras/149d47933d8bf4cde9926926fbd17aa0.webp?t=1784047129\" width=616 height=63 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Radio Dialogue choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration of a retro-fitted underground missile silo</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Third and First-person combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical and stealth options</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique, low-poly 3D art style inspired by classic anime</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lush, synth-heavy soundtrack</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SHE is a retro survival horror game visually inspired by Akira, and blends classic third-person <br>survival horror gameplay with the tactical stealth action of Metal Gear Solid 2.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4686060/extras/887f3426e84c05f0397a5b09d60ebf9f.webp?t=1784047129\" width=616 height=63 /></span></p